  <entry>
    <title>Python速成（应付新生赛）</title>
    <url>/2026/10/17/Python%E9%80%9F%E6%88%90%EF%BC%88%E5%BA%94%E4%BB%98%E6%96%B0%E7%94%9F%E8%B5%9B%EF%BC%89/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<p>前言：最近都是跟着cs50在自学基础，但是又对学校ACM校队组织的新生赛感兴趣，想试一下，怎料这种竞赛都是推荐用C++，跟着cs50我都是学了基础的c以及接触python，尝试过转C++，但是时间又不是很够（实际上新生线上赛只剩3天就结束了），我从cs50那里已经充分感受到python的简洁易懂，于是乎，我决定先用python应付一下新生赛（这种比赛总不可能要求很高吧，我那浅陋的python储备应该够用），为了防止爆零，我叫大肥鱼总结了一些模板给我记忆学习（所以正文部分是ai生成🥰）。</p>
<h2 id="一、输入模板"><a href="#一、输入模板" class="headerlink" title="一、输入模板"></a>一、输入模板</h2><h3 id="1-读一个整数"><a href="#1-读一个整数" class="headerlink" title="1. 读一个整数"></a>1. 读一个整数</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">n = <span class="built_in">int</span>(<span class="built_in">input</span>())  <span class="comment"># 读一行，转成整数</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(n)  <span class="comment"># 输出</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="2-读两个整数"><a href="#2-读两个整数" class="headerlink" title="2. 读两个整数"></a>2. 读两个整数</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">a, b = <span class="built_in">map</span>(<span class="built_in">int</span>, <span class="built_in">input</span>().split())  <span class="comment"># 按空格切开，转成两个整数</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(a + b)  <span class="comment"># 输出和</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="3-读一行多个整数，存列表"><a href="#3-读一行多个整数，存列表" class="headerlink" title="3. 读一行多个整数，存列表"></a>3. 读一行多个整数，存列表</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">a = <span class="built_in">list</span>(<span class="built_in">map</span>(<span class="built_in">int</span>, <span class="built_in">input</span>().split()))  <span class="comment"># 读一行，切成整数列表</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(a)  <span class="comment"># 输出列表</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="4-先读-n，再读-n-行，每行一个数"><a href="#4-先读-n，再读-n-行，每行一个数" class="headerlink" title="4. 先读 n，再读 n 行，每行一个数"></a>4. 先读 n，再读 n 行，每行一个数</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">n = <span class="built_in">int</span>(<span class="built_in">input</span>())  <span class="comment"># 读 n</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(n):  <span class="comment"># 循环 n 次</span></span><br><span class="line">    x = <span class="built_in">int</span>(<span class="built_in">input</span>())  <span class="comment"># 每次读一个整数</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(x)  <span class="comment"># 输出</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="5-先读-n，再读-n-行，每行两个数"><a href="#5-先读-n，再读-n-行，每行两个数" class="headerlink" title="5. 先读 n，再读 n 行，每行两个数"></a>5. 先读 n，再读 n 行，每行两个数</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">n = <span class="built_in">int</span>(<span class="built_in">input</span>())  <span class="comment"># 读 n</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(n):  <span class="comment"># 循环 n 次</span></span><br><span class="line">    a, b = <span class="built_in">map</span>(<span class="built_in">int</span>, <span class="built_in">input</span>().split())  <span class="comment"># 每行读两个整数</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(a + b)  <span class="comment"># 输出和</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="6-多组测试，先读-T"><a href="#6-多组测试，先读-T" class="headerlink" title="6. 多组测试，先读 T"></a>6. 多组测试，先读 T</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">T = <span class="built_in">int</span>(<span class="built_in">input</span>())  <span class="comment"># 读组数</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(T):  <span class="comment"># 循环 T 次</span></span><br><span class="line">    a, b = <span class="built_in">map</span>(<span class="built_in">int</span>, <span class="built_in">input</span>().split())  <span class="comment"># 每组读两个数</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(a + b)  <span class="comment"># 输出</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="7-不知道多少组，一直读到结束"><a href="#7-不知道多少组，一直读到结束" class="headerlink" title="7. 不知道多少组，一直读到结束"></a>7. 不知道多少组，一直读到结束</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">while</span> <span class="literal">True</span>:  <span class="comment"># 无限循环</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">try</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        a, b = <span class="built_in">map</span>(<span class="built_in">int</span>, <span class="built_in">input</span>().split())  <span class="comment"># 尝试读两个数</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">print</span>(a + b)  <span class="comment"># 输出</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">except</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">break</span>  <span class="comment"># 读不到了就退出</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h2 id="二、输出模板"><a href="#二、输出模板" class="headerlink" title="二、输出模板"></a>二、输出模板</h2><h3 id="1-普通输出"><a href="#1-普通输出" class="headerlink" title="1. 普通输出"></a>1. 普通输出</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(ans)  <span class="comment"># 输出 ans，自动换行</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="2-一行输出多个值，空格隔开"><a href="#2-一行输出多个值，空格隔开" class="headerlink" title="2. 一行输出多个值，空格隔开"></a>2. 一行输出多个值，空格隔开</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(a, b, c)  <span class="comment"># 输出 a b c，中间自动加空格</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="3-输出列表，空格隔开"><a href="#3-输出列表，空格隔开" class="headerlink" title="3. 输出列表，空格隔开"></a>3. 输出列表，空格隔开</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(*a)  <span class="comment"># *a 表示把列表每个元素拆开输出，默认空格隔开</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="4-保留两位小数"><a href="#4-保留两位小数" class="headerlink" title="4. 保留两位小数"></a>4. 保留两位小数</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;%.2f&quot;</span> % ans)  <span class="comment"># 输出 ans，保留两位小数</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="5-不换行输出"><a href="#5-不换行输出" class="headerlink" title="5. 不换行输出"></a>5. 不换行输出</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(ans, end=<span class="string">&quot;&quot;</span>)  <span class="comment"># 输出 ans，不换行</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h2 id="三、条件判断"><a href="#三、条件判断" class="headerlink" title="三、条件判断"></a>三、条件判断</h2><h3 id="1-判断奇偶"><a href="#1-判断奇偶" class="headerlink" title="1. 判断奇偶"></a>1. 判断奇偶</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">n = <span class="built_in">int</span>(<span class="built_in">input</span>())  <span class="comment"># 读整数</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> n % <span class="number">2</span> == <span class="number">0</span>:  <span class="comment"># 余数为 0</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;Even&quot;</span>)  <span class="comment"># 偶数</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">else</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;Odd&quot;</span>)  <span class="comment"># 奇数</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="2-判断正负零"><a href="#2-判断正负零" class="headerlink" title="2. 判断正负零"></a>2. 判断正负零</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">n = <span class="built_in">int</span>(<span class="built_in">input</span>())  <span class="comment"># 读整数</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> n &gt; <span class="number">0</span>:  <span class="comment"># 大于 0</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;正数&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">elif</span> n &lt; <span class="number">0</span>:  <span class="comment"># 小于 0</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;负数&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">else</span>:  <span class="comment"># 等于 0</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;零&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="3-判断闰年"><a href="#3-判断闰年" class="headerlink" title="3. 判断闰年"></a>3. 判断闰年</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">y = <span class="built_in">int</span>(<span class="built_in">input</span>())  <span class="comment"># 读年份</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> (y % <span class="number">4</span> == <span class="number">0</span> <span class="keyword">and</span> y % <span class="number">100</span> != <span class="number">0</span>) <span class="keyword">or</span> y % <span class="number">400</span> == <span class="number">0</span>:  <span class="comment"># 闰年条件</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;是闰年&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">else</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;不是闰年&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="4-判断大小写"><a href="#4-判断大小写" class="headerlink" title="4. 判断大小写"></a>4. 判断大小写</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">ch = <span class="built_in">input</span>()  <span class="comment"># 读一个字符</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> ch.isupper():  <span class="comment"># 是否大写</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;大写&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">elif</span> ch.islower():  <span class="comment"># 是否小写</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;小写&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">else</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;其他&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="5-判断是否回文"><a href="#5-判断是否回文" class="headerlink" title="5. 判断是否回文"></a>5. 判断是否回文</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">s = <span class="built_in">input</span>()  <span class="comment"># 读字符串</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> s == s[::-<span class="number">1</span>]:  <span class="comment"># 反转后相等就是回文</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;是回文&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">else</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;不是回文&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h2 id="四、循环"><a href="#四、循环" class="headerlink" title="四、循环"></a>四、循环</h2><h3 id="1-从-1-加到-n"><a href="#1-从-1-加到-n" class="headerlink" title="1. 从 1 加到 n"></a>1. 从 1 加到 n</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">n = <span class="built_in">int</span>(<span class="built_in">input</span>())  <span class="comment"># 读 n</span></span><br><span class="line">ans = <span class="number">0</span>  <span class="comment"># 累加器</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="number">1</span>, n + <span class="number">1</span>):  <span class="comment"># i 从 1 到 n</span></span><br><span class="line">    ans += i  <span class="comment"># 累加</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(ans)  <span class="comment"># 输出</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="2-求-n-的阶乘"><a href="#2-求-n-的阶乘" class="headerlink" title="2. 求 n 的阶乘"></a>2. 求 n 的阶乘</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">n = <span class="built_in">int</span>(<span class="built_in">input</span>())  <span class="comment"># 读 n</span></span><br><span class="line">ans = <span class="number">1</span>  <span class="comment"># 乘法器初始为 1</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="number">1</span>, n + <span class="number">1</span>):  <span class="comment"># 1 到 n</span></span><br><span class="line">    ans *= i  <span class="comment"># 累乘</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(ans)  <span class="comment"># 输出</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="3-斐波那契前-n-项"><a href="#3-斐波那契前-n-项" class="headerlink" title="3. 斐波那契前 n 项"></a>3. 斐波那契前 n 项</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">n = <span class="built_in">int</span>(<span class="built_in">input</span>())  <span class="comment"># 读 n</span></span><br><span class="line">a, b = <span class="number">0</span>, <span class="number">1</span>  <span class="comment"># 前两项</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(n):  <span class="comment"># 循环 n 次</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(a, end=<span class="string">&quot; &quot;</span>)  <span class="comment"># 输出当前项，空格隔开</span></span><br><span class="line">    a, b = b, a + b  <span class="comment"># 更新</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="4-九九乘法表"><a href="#4-九九乘法表" class="headerlink" title="4. 九九乘法表"></a>4. 九九乘法表</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="number">1</span>, <span class="number">10</span>):  <span class="comment"># 外层 1 到 9</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> j <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="number">1</span>, i + <span class="number">1</span>):  <span class="comment"># 内层 1 到 i</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">f&quot;<span class="subst">&#123;j&#125;</span>*<span class="subst">&#123;i&#125;</span>=<span class="subst">&#123;i*j&#125;</span>&quot;</span>, end=<span class="string">&quot; &quot;</span>)  <span class="comment"># 输出一项</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>()  <span class="comment"># 换行</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="5-一直循环直到条件满足"><a href="#5-一直循环直到条件满足" class="headerlink" title="5. 一直循环直到条件满足"></a>5. 一直循环直到条件满足</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">while</span> <span class="literal">True</span>:  <span class="comment"># 无限循环</span></span><br><span class="line">    n = <span class="built_in">int</span>(<span class="built_in">input</span>())  <span class="comment"># 读一个数</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> n == <span class="number">0</span>:  <span class="comment"># 如果是 0</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">break</span>  <span class="comment"># 跳出循环</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(n)  <span class="comment"># 否则输出</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h2 id="五、列表操作"><a href="#五、列表操作" class="headerlink" title="五、列表操作"></a>五、列表操作</h2><h3 id="1-创建列表"><a href="#1-创建列表" class="headerlink" title="1. 创建列表"></a>1. 创建列表</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">a = [<span class="number">1</span>, <span class="number">2</span>, <span class="number">3</span>]  <span class="comment"># 直接写</span></span><br><span class="line">b = <span class="built_in">list</span>(<span class="built_in">map</span>(<span class="built_in">int</span>, <span class="built_in">input</span>().split()))  <span class="comment"># 从输入读</span></span><br><span class="line">c = [<span class="number">0</span>] * <span class="number">5</span>  <span class="comment"># 五个 0</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="2-添加元素"><a href="#2-添加元素" class="headerlink" title="2. 添加元素"></a>2. 添加元素</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">a.append(<span class="number">4</span>)  <span class="comment"># 末尾加一个</span></span><br><span class="line">a.insert(<span class="number">0</span>, <span class="number">0</span>)  <span class="comment"># 在下标 0 处插入</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="3-访问和切片"><a href="#3-访问和切片" class="headerlink" title="3. 访问和切片"></a>3. 访问和切片</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(a[<span class="number">0</span>])  <span class="comment"># 第一个</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(a[-<span class="number">1</span>])  <span class="comment"># 最后一个</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(a[<span class="number">1</span>:<span class="number">3</span>])  <span class="comment"># 下标 1 到 2</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(a[::-<span class="number">1</span>])  <span class="comment"># 反转</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="4-求和、最大、最小"><a href="#4-求和、最大、最小" class="headerlink" title="4. 求和、最大、最小"></a>4. 求和、最大、最小</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="built_in">sum</span>(a))  <span class="comment"># 总和</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="built_in">max</span>(a))  <span class="comment"># 最大值</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="built_in">min</span>(a))  <span class="comment"># 最小值</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="built_in">len</span>(a))  <span class="comment"># 长度</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="5-排序"><a href="#5-排序" class="headerlink" title="5. 排序"></a>5. 排序</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">a.sort()  <span class="comment"># 升序，改变原列表</span></span><br><span class="line">a.sort(reverse=<span class="literal">True</span>)  <span class="comment"># 降序</span></span><br><span class="line">b = <span class="built_in">sorted</span>(a)  <span class="comment"># 升序，返回新列表</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="6-计数"><a href="#6-计数" class="headerlink" title="6. 计数"></a>6. 计数</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(a.count(<span class="number">3</span>))  <span class="comment"># 3 出现了几次</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="7-查找下标"><a href="#7-查找下标" class="headerlink" title="7. 查找下标"></a>7. 查找下标</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(a.index(<span class="number">3</span>))  <span class="comment"># 3 第一次出现的下标</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="8-删除"><a href="#8-删除" class="headerlink" title="8. 删除"></a>8. 删除</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">a.remove(<span class="number">3</span>)  <span class="comment"># 删除第一个 3</span></span><br><span class="line">a.pop()  <span class="comment"># 删除最后一个</span></span><br><span class="line">a.pop(<span class="number">0</span>)  <span class="comment"># 删除下标 0</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="9-列表推导式（简单好用）"><a href="#9-列表推导式（简单好用）" class="headerlink" title="9. 列表推导式（简单好用）"></a>9. 列表推导式（简单好用）</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">a = [i <span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="number">5</span>)]  <span class="comment"># [0,1,2,3,4]</span></span><br><span class="line">b = [i * <span class="number">2</span> <span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> a]  <span class="comment"># 每个乘 2</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="10-二维列表"><a href="#10-二维列表" class="headerlink" title="10. 二维列表"></a>10. 二维列表</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">matrix = [[<span class="number">0</span>] * <span class="number">3</span> <span class="keyword">for</span> _ <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="number">2</span>)]  <span class="comment"># 2 行 3 列全 0</span></span><br><span class="line">matrix[<span class="number">0</span>][<span class="number">1</span>] = <span class="number">5</span>  <span class="comment"># 第 0 行第 1 列改成 5</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h2 id="六、字符串操作"><a href="#六、字符串操作" class="headerlink" title="六、字符串操作"></a>六、字符串操作</h2><h3 id="1-读字符串"><a href="#1-读字符串" class="headerlink" title="1. 读字符串"></a>1. 读字符串</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">s = <span class="built_in">input</span>()  <span class="comment"># 读一行</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="2-长度、反转"><a href="#2-长度、反转" class="headerlink" title="2. 长度、反转"></a>2. 长度、反转</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="built_in">len</span>(s))  <span class="comment"># 长度</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(s[::-<span class="number">1</span>])  <span class="comment"># 反转</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="3-大小写转换"><a href="#3-大小写转换" class="headerlink" title="3. 大小写转换"></a>3. 大小写转换</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(s.upper())  <span class="comment"># 全大写</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(s.lower())  <span class="comment"># 全小写</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="4-查找和替换"><a href="#4-查找和替换" class="headerlink" title="4. 查找和替换"></a>4. 查找和替换</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(s.find(<span class="string">&quot;a&quot;</span>))  <span class="comment"># 找 a 的下标，找不到返回 -1</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(s.replace(<span class="string">&quot;a&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;b&quot;</span>))  <span class="comment"># 把 a 换成 b</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="5-拆分和连接"><a href="#5-拆分和连接" class="headerlink" title="5. 拆分和连接"></a>5. 拆分和连接</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">words = s.split()  <span class="comment"># 按空格拆成列表</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot; &quot;</span>.join(words))  <span class="comment"># 用空格连起来</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="6-判断子串"><a href="#6-判断子串" class="headerlink" title="6. 判断子串"></a>6. 判断子串</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> <span class="string">&quot;abc&quot;</span> <span class="keyword">in</span> s:  <span class="comment"># 包含 abc</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;有&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="7-统计字符"><a href="#7-统计字符" class="headerlink" title="7. 统计字符"></a>7. 统计字符</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(s.count(<span class="string">&quot;a&quot;</span>))  <span class="comment"># a 出现次数</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="8-去空格"><a href="#8-去空格" class="headerlink" title="8. 去空格"></a>8. 去空格</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(s.strip())  <span class="comment"># 去掉首尾空格</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="9-遍历字符"><a href="#9-遍历字符" class="headerlink" title="9. 遍历字符"></a>9. 遍历字符</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> ch <span class="keyword">in</span> s:  <span class="comment"># 每个字符</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(ch)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="10-字符串转列表"><a href="#10-字符串转列表" class="headerlink" title="10. 字符串转列表"></a>10. 字符串转列表</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">a = <span class="built_in">list</span>(s)  <span class="comment"># 每个字符变成列表元素</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h2 id="七、字典和集合"><a href="#七、字典和集合" class="headerlink" title="七、字典和集合"></a>七、字典和集合</h2><h3 id="1-字典创建"><a href="#1-字典创建" class="headerlink" title="1. 字典创建"></a>1. 字典创建</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">d = &#123;&#125;  <span class="comment"># 空字典</span></span><br><span class="line">d = &#123;<span class="string">&quot;a&quot;</span>: <span class="number">1</span>, <span class="string">&quot;b&quot;</span>: <span class="number">2</span>&#125;  <span class="comment"># 直接写</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="2-增删改查"><a href="#2-增删改查" class="headerlink" title="2. 增删改查"></a>2. 增删改查</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">d[<span class="string">&quot;c&quot;</span>] = <span class="number">3</span>  <span class="comment"># 添加或修改</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(d[<span class="string">&quot;a&quot;</span>])  <span class="comment"># 读取</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(d.get(<span class="string">&quot;x&quot;</span>, <span class="number">0</span>))  <span class="comment"># 读取，没有返回 0</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">del</span> d[<span class="string">&quot;a&quot;</span>]  <span class="comment"># 删除</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="3-遍历字典"><a href="#3-遍历字典" class="headerlink" title="3. 遍历字典"></a>3. 遍历字典</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> key <span class="keyword">in</span> d:  <span class="comment"># 遍历键</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(key, d[key])</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> key, value <span class="keyword">in</span> d.items():  <span class="comment"># 遍历键值对</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(key, value)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="4-集合去重"><a href="#4-集合去重" class="headerlink" title="4. 集合去重"></a>4. 集合去重</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">a = [<span class="number">1</span>, <span class="number">2</span>, <span class="number">2</span>, <span class="number">3</span>]</span><br><span class="line">s = <span class="built_in">set</span>(a)  <span class="comment"># 去重变成集合</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(s)  <span class="comment"># &#123;1,2,3&#125;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="5-交集并集"><a href="#5-交集并集" class="headerlink" title="5. 交集并集"></a>5. 交集并集</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">a = &#123;<span class="number">1</span>, <span class="number">2</span>, <span class="number">3</span>&#125;</span><br><span class="line">b = &#123;<span class="number">2</span>, <span class="number">3</span>, <span class="number">4</span>&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(a &amp; b)  <span class="comment"># 交集 &#123;2,3&#125;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(a | b)  <span class="comment"># 并集 &#123;1,2,3,4&#125;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h2 id="八、数学函数"><a href="#八、数学函数" class="headerlink" title="八、数学函数"></a>八、数学函数</h2><h3 id="1-绝对值、幂、整除、取余"><a href="#1-绝对值、幂、整除、取余" class="headerlink" title="1. 绝对值、幂、整除、取余"></a>1. 绝对值、幂、整除、取余</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="built_in">abs</span>(-<span class="number">5</span>))  <span class="comment"># 5</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="number">2</span> ** <span class="number">3</span>)  <span class="comment"># 8</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="number">7</span> // <span class="number">2</span>)  <span class="comment"># 3</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="number">7</span> % <span class="number">2</span>)  <span class="comment"># 1</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="2-平方根"><a href="#2-平方根" class="headerlink" title="2. 平方根"></a>2. 平方根</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> math</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(math.sqrt(<span class="number">16</span>))  <span class="comment"># 4.0</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="3-最大公约数、最小公倍数"><a href="#3-最大公约数、最小公倍数" class="headerlink" title="3. 最大公约数、最小公倍数"></a>3. 最大公约数、最小公倍数</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> math</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(math.gcd(<span class="number">12</span>, <span class="number">18</span>))  <span class="comment"># 6</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="number">12</span> * <span class="number">18</span> // math.gcd(<span class="number">12</span>, <span class="number">18</span>))  <span class="comment"># 36</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="4-进制转换"><a href="#4-进制转换" class="headerlink" title="4. 进制转换"></a>4. 进制转换</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="built_in">bin</span>(<span class="number">10</span>))  <span class="comment"># 0b1010</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="built_in">oct</span>(<span class="number">10</span>))  <span class="comment"># 0o12</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="built_in">hex</span>(<span class="number">10</span>))  <span class="comment"># 0xa</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="5-四舍五入"><a href="#5-四舍五入" class="headerlink" title="5. 四舍五入"></a>5. 四舍五入</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="built_in">round</span>(<span class="number">3.14159</span>, <span class="number">2</span>))  <span class="comment"># 3.14</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h2 id="九、常用内置函数"><a href="#九、常用内置函数" class="headerlink" title="九、常用内置函数"></a>九、常用内置函数</h2><h3 id="1-长度、求和、最大最小"><a href="#1-长度、求和、最大最小" class="headerlink" title="1. 长度、求和、最大最小"></a>1. 长度、求和、最大最小</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="built_in">len</span>(a))  <span class="comment"># 长度</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="built_in">sum</span>(a))  <span class="comment"># 求和</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="built_in">max</span>(a))  <span class="comment"># 最大</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="built_in">min</span>(a))  <span class="comment"># 最小</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="2-排序"><a href="#2-排序" class="headerlink" title="2. 排序"></a>2. 排序</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">a.sort()  <span class="comment"># 升序</span></span><br><span class="line">a.sort(reverse=<span class="literal">True</span>)  <span class="comment"># 降序</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="3-类型转换"><a href="#3-类型转换" class="headerlink" title="3. 类型转换"></a>3. 类型转换</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">int</span>(<span class="string">&quot;5&quot;</span>)  <span class="comment"># 字符串转整数</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">str</span>(<span class="number">5</span>)  <span class="comment"># 整数转字符串</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">float</span>(<span class="string">&quot;3.14&quot;</span>)  <span class="comment"># 转小数</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">list</span>(<span class="string">&quot;abc&quot;</span>)  <span class="comment"># 转列表 [&#x27;a&#x27;,&#x27;b&#x27;,&#x27;c&#x27;]</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="4-范围"><a href="#4-范围" class="headerlink" title="4. 范围"></a>4. 范围</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="number">5</span>)  <span class="comment"># 0,1,2,3,4</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="number">1</span>, <span class="number">6</span>)  <span class="comment"># 1,2,3,4,5</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="number">0</span>, <span class="number">10</span>, <span class="number">2</span>)  <span class="comment"># 0,2,4,6,8</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="5-枚举"><a href="#5-枚举" class="headerlink" title="5. 枚举"></a>5. 枚举</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> i, x <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">enumerate</span>(a):  <span class="comment"># i 是下标，x 是值</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(i, x)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h2 id="十、综合小例子"><a href="#十、综合小例子" class="headerlink" title="十、综合小例子"></a>十、综合小例子</h2><h3 id="1-读-n-个数，求和、最大值、排序后输出"><a href="#1-读-n-个数，求和、最大值、排序后输出" class="headerlink" title="1. 读 n 个数，求和、最大值、排序后输出"></a>1. 读 n 个数，求和、最大值、排序后输出</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">n = <span class="built_in">int</span>(<span class="built_in">input</span>())  <span class="comment"># 读个数</span></span><br><span class="line">a = <span class="built_in">list</span>(<span class="built_in">map</span>(<span class="built_in">int</span>, <span class="built_in">input</span>().split()))  <span class="comment"># 读列表</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="built_in">sum</span>(a))  <span class="comment"># 和</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="built_in">max</span>(a))  <span class="comment"># 最大</span></span><br><span class="line">a.sort()  <span class="comment"># 排序</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(*a)  <span class="comment"># 输出</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="2-统计每个数字出现次数"><a href="#2-统计每个数字出现次数" class="headerlink" title="2. 统计每个数字出现次数"></a>2. 统计每个数字出现次数</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">n = <span class="built_in">int</span>(<span class="built_in">input</span>())  <span class="comment"># 读个数</span></span><br><span class="line">a = <span class="built_in">list</span>(<span class="built_in">map</span>(<span class="built_in">int</span>, <span class="built_in">input</span>().split()))  <span class="comment"># 读列表</span></span><br><span class="line">d = &#123;&#125;  <span class="comment"># 空字典</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> x <span class="keyword">in</span> a:  <span class="comment"># 遍历每个数</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> x <span class="keyword">in</span> d:  <span class="comment"># 如果已经记录过</span></span><br><span class="line">        d[x] += <span class="number">1</span>  <span class="comment"># 次数加 1</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">else</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        d[x] = <span class="number">1</span>  <span class="comment"># 第一次出现</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> key <span class="keyword">in</span> d:  <span class="comment"># 输出</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(key, d[key])</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="3-判断素数"><a href="#3-判断素数" class="headerlink" title="3. 判断素数"></a>3. 判断素数</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">n = <span class="built_in">int</span>(<span class="built_in">input</span>())  <span class="comment"># 读整数</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> n &lt; <span class="number">2</span>:  <span class="comment"># 小于 2 不是素数</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;不是素数&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">else</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    ok = <span class="literal">True</span>  <span class="comment"># 假设是素数</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="number">2</span>, <span class="built_in">int</span>(n ** <span class="number">0.5</span>) + <span class="number">1</span>):  <span class="comment"># 试除到平方根</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> n % i == <span class="number">0</span>:  <span class="comment"># 能整除</span></span><br><span class="line">            ok = <span class="literal">False</span>  <span class="comment"># 不是素数</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">break</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> ok:</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;是素数&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">else</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;不是素数&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<hr>
<p>后话：线上赛极其简单，也是顺利通过了。因为不喜欢刷这种算法题，也不愿意把太多时间砸在这上面（我数学思维可能不太行？（借口）），总之我放弃了线下赛资格（也就是不打算进ACM校队了），以上这些纯用于应付比赛的东西也就没啥大用了。我不删这条，就当留作纪念吧。</p>
]]></content>
